  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEANO II - ASEAN - Norway Capacity Building Project to Reduce Plastic Pollution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on ASEANO 1, ASEANO 2 aims to continue the support to plastic pollution reduction measures among AMS by finding solutions to manage, mitigate and prevent plastic waste.  The objective is to develop targeted and cost-efficient prevention and mitigation measures for plastic pollution in ASEAN. The geographic will include the three countries from Phase 1 (Indonesia, Philippines and Vietnam)  and  scale up to include Cambodia in addition to engaging stakeholders inThailand.</narrative>
  </description>
